--------------------------- Changelog -----------------------------

1.1.c - UNRELEASED
Adjusted - Five per row: long market names go on two lines instead of touching the button edge

1.1.b
Added - Vanilla look on one row setting: keeps vanilla buttons when they all fit in one row, off by default

1.1.a
Added - Tile unfold setting for Tiles: On hover (default), On click or Never
Adjusted - Renamed the Unfold on hover layout to Tiles, saved settings carry over
Adjusted - Updated to Starsector 0.98.5a

1.0.a
Added - Market buttons fill each row on the cargo and fleet screens, with Storage at the bottom right
Added - Three layouts: Unfold on hover (default), Stretched and Five per row
Added - Adjustable unfold time from 0 to 1 second, defaulting to 0.1
Added - Selected button highlights: Animated (default), Bright band and Off
Added - Button backgrounds fit their frames; enabled by default
